ly $2.3 million with substantial outside support, while Republican Riley Owen has raised about $133,000 with minimal cash on hand. A September survey of likely voters showed McAdams leading by a wide margin, and both major prediction markets price his win probability near 96 percent.\n\nDebate coverage portrays two moderates finding common ground on prices and AI policy while splitting on the economy and debt, suggesting a low-drama race unlikely to produce a dramatic swing. The fundamentals, money, polling, and markets all point the same direction, making this district safe for the Democratic side in the forecast.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.9908, "margin": 20.9}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.99, "margin": 20.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.9893, "margin": 21.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.9909, "margin": 21.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.9895, "margin": 21.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.9899, "margin": 21.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.9906, "margin": 21.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.9886, "margin": 20.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.9895, "margin": 20.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.9907, "margin": 21.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.99, "margin": 21.0}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.9979, "margin": 28.0}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.9958, "margin": 26.0}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.997, "margin": 27.0}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.9991, "margin": 28.0}]}